parameters.jsonBody:
={
  "model": "sonar",
  "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "What are the current job market trends for {{ $json.roles }} roles in {{ $json.location }}? How many job postings exist, which companies are hiring most, and what skills are being demanded most frequently this week?"}],
  "search_recency_filter": "week"
}

={
  "model": "sonar",
  "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Which tech companies in India announced layoffs or hiring freezes vs new hiring sprees this week? Focus on AI and automation roles at {{ $json.experience_level }} experience level."}],
  "search_recency_filter": "week"
}

={
  "model": "sonar",
  "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "What are current salary ranges for {{ $json.roles }} at {{ $json.experience_level }} experience in {{ $json.location }}? Include data from LinkedIn Salary, Glassdoor, Levels.fyi if available."}],
  "search_recency_filter": "month"
}

parameters.text:
=Compile this job market data into actionable intelligence for a job seeker in AI/automation.

Target Roles: {{ $('Set Market Config').item.json.roles }}
Location: {{ $('Set Market Config').item.json.location }}
Experience: {{ $('Set Market Config').item.json.experience_level }}

Job Trends:
{{ $('Fetch LinkedIn Job Trends').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}

Hiring Signals:
{{ $('Fetch Hiring Signals').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}

Salary Data:
{{ $('Fetch Salary Signals').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}

Return JSON:
{
  "market_temperature": "hot/warm/cool/cold",
  "top_hiring_companies": [{"company": "", "roles": [], "urgency": "high/medium"}],
  "most_demanded_skills": [{"skill": "", "frequency": "very high/high/medium"}],
  "salary_ranges": [{"role": "", "min": "", "max": "", "median": ""}],
  "companies_to_avoid": [],
  "best_application_opportunities": [],
  "skill_gaps_to_fill": [],
  "market_summary": "3-4 sentence weekly summary",
  "action_items": []
}

=💼 *Weekly Job Market Brief — AI/Automation Roles*

*Market Temperature:* {{ $json.market_temperature.toUpperCase() }}

{{ $json.market_summary }}

*Top Hiring Companies:*
{{ $json.top_hiring_companies.slice(0,3).map(c=>`• ${c.company}: ${c.roles.join(', ')}`).join('\n') }}

*Most Demanded Skills:*
{{ $json.most_demanded_skills.slice(0,5).map(s=>`• ${s.skill} (${s.frequency})`).join('\n') }}

*Action Items:*
{{ $json.action_items.map(a=>`• ${a}`).join('\n') }}
